# "Return the top creature card of your graveyard to the battlefield. That creature gains haste until end of turn. Exile it at
# the beginning of the next end step." Bot1's graveyard, top first when Corpse Dance is cast on turn 5: Lightning Bolt (not a
# creature, so skipped), Dark Confidant (Bot2's Bolt killed it on turn 2), Ornithopter, Lightning Bolt. The Confidant, the top creature
# card, comes back and attacks at once (haste) for 2; the Ornithopter below stays; at the end step the Confidant is exiled.
# No buyback: Corpse Dance goes to the graveyard.

